{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"0458045454f2ad4782aa3cd9cdb34df5905362229d18f9c9420fda9a2335f70a"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1350d0ed04da8c7e3fed08bd736ed79e95d6fe9784e5e5c74be051f340670cbf","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Several weeks of dedicated work","evidence":"[D14:11 | 12:35 am on 14 August, 2023] Dave: Yeah, the project is going great! Here's a pic of the car I'm restoring. It's pretty cool seeing it go from a beat-up mess to a real beauty.\n[D20:1 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, good to catch up again! Had a tough time with my car project. Worked on the engine of the vintage Mustang, thought I'd fixed it, but when I started it up, heard a weird noise. So disappointing after putting so much work in. Take a look at the engine!\n[D21:4 | 2:44 pm on 4 October, 2023] Dave: Wow, Calvin, that car looks great! Working on cars really helps me relax, it's therapeutic to see them come back to life. I've been working on that Ford Mustang I found in a junkyard - it was in bad shape, but I knew it had potential.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cacaff78-dd8c-56e0-908c-d0b84a796a0b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e13e7a112b3f97ac987d41a47257d64a9f46898a1df52fb285143696b719bdd5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How long did Dave's work on the Ford Mustang take?","referenceAnswer":"nearly two months","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e13e7a112b3f97ac987d41a47257d64a9f46898a1df52fb285143696b719bdd5"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}